hadiths[count]{hadithnumber,text}:
"3048","###\n Narrated to us Yunus bin Abd al-A'la and Muhammad bin Abd Allah bin al-Hakam, who said: Narrated to us Ibn Wahb, who informed me that Jarir bin Hazim narrated to him from Sulayman bin Mihran, from Abu Dabyan, from Ibn Abbas (RA), who said: Ali bin Abi Talib (RA) passed by a madwoman from the tribe of Banu Fulan who had committed adultery. Umar (RA) ordered that she be stoned to death. Ali (RA)"
